RKETPLACE INSIGHTS INTEGRATED INTO COSTAR'S INDUSTRY-LEADING INFORMATION,."}{'symbol': 'COST', 'date': '2023-05-03 16:15:00', 'title': 'COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION REPORTS APRIL SALES RESULTS', 'text': 'ISSAQUAH, WASH., MAY 03, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION (“COSTCO” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NASDAQ: COST) TODAY REPORTED NET SALES OF $17.85 BILLION FOR THE RETAIL MONTH OF APRIL, THE FOUR WEEKS ENDED APRIL 30, 2023, AN INCREASE OF 3.0 PERCENT FROM $17.33 BILLION LAST YEAR.'}{'symbol': 'CMI', 'date': '2023-05-03 11:00:00', 'title': 'CUMMINS AND ACCELERA SHOWCASE BROADEST PORTFOLIO OF DECARBONIZING TECHNOLOGIES WITH AN EMPHASIS ON HYDROGEN', 'text': "COLUMBUS, IND.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #CUMMINS--CUMMINS INC. (NYSE: CMI) AND ACCELERA™ BY CUMMINS, CUMMINS' ZERO-EMISSIONS TECHNOLOGY BRAND, WILL SHOWCASE A VARIETY OF TECHNOLOGIES IN THEIR BOOTH AT ADVANCED CLEAN TRANSPORTATION EXPO (MAY 2 TO 4, ANAHEIM, CALIFORNIA). THE LINE-UP EMPHASIZES THE ROLE THAT HYDROGEN WILL PLAY AS PART OF DESTINATION ZERO, CUMMINS' STRATEGY TO GO FURTHER, FASTER TO REDUCE GREENHOUSE GAS (GHG) AND AIR QUALITY IMPACTS OF ITS PRODUCTS AND REACH ZERO EMISSIONS BY 2050. THE COMPANY WIL."}{'symbol': 'CVS', 'date': '2023-05-03 06:30:00', 'title': 'CVS HEALTH REPORTS FIRST QUARTER RESULTS, COMPLETES ACQUISITIONS OF SIGNIFY HEALTH AND OAK STREET HEALTH', 'text': 'WOONSOCKET, R.I. , MAY 3, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CVS HEALTH CORPORATION (NYSE: CVS) TODAY ANNOUNCED OPERATING RESULTS FOR THE THREE MONTHS ENDED MARCH 31, 2023.'}{'symbol': 'DHR', 'date': '2023-05-03 03:30:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ACTION NOTICE: THE SCHALL LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES IT IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS AGAINST DANAHER CORPORATION AND ENCOURAGES INVESTORS WITH LOSSES TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, CA / ACCESSWIRE / MAY 3, 2023 / THE SCHALL LAW FIRM, A NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LITIGATION FIRM, ANNOUNCES THAT IT IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF DANAHER CORPORATION ("DANAHER" OR "THE COMPANY") (NYSE:DHR) FOR VIOLATIONS OF THE SECURITIES LAWS. THE INVESTIGATION FOCUSES ON WHETHER THE COMPANY ISSUED FALSE AND/OR MISLEADING STATEMENTS AND/OR FAILED TO DISCLOSE INFORMATION PERTINENT TO INVESTORS.'}{'symbol': 'DRI', 'date': '2023-05-03 21:41:00', 'title': "RUTH'S HOSPITALITY INVESTOR ALERT BY THE FORMER ATTORNEY GENERAL OF LOUISIANA: KAHN SWICK & FOTI, LLC INVESTIGATES ADEQUACY OF PRICE AND PROCESS IN PROPOSED SALE OF RUTH'S HOSPITALITY GROUP, INC. - RUTH", 'text': "NEW ORLEANS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FORMER ATTORNEY GENERAL OF LOUISIANA CHARLES C. FOTI, JR., ESQ. AND THE LAW FIRM OF KAHN SWICK & FOTI, LLC (“KSF”) ARE INVESTIGATING THE PROPOSED SALE OF RUTH'S HOSPITALITY GROUP, INC. (NASDAQGS: RUTH) TO DARDEN RESTAURANTS, INC. (NYSE: DRI). UNDER THE TERMS OF THE PROPOSED TRANSACTION, SHAREHOLDERS OF RUTH'S WILL RECEIVE $21.50 IN CASH FOR EACH SHARE OF RUTH'S THAT THEY OWN. KSF IS SEEKING TO DETERMINE WHETHER THIS CONSIDERATION AND THE PROCESS THAT LED TO IT."}{'symbol': 'DRI', 'date': '2023-05-03 08:00:00', 'title': "DARDEN RESTAURANTS TO ACQUIRE RUTH'S HOSPITALITY GROUP IN $715 MILLION TRANSACTION", 'text': 'ORLANDO, FLA. , MAY 3, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DARDEN RESTAURANTS, INC. ("DARDEN") (NYSE:DRI) AND RUTH\'S HOSPITALITY GROUP, INC. ("RUTH\'S") (NASDAQ: RUTH), JOINTLY ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THEY HAVE ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE MERGER AGREEMENT PURSUANT TO WHICH DARDEN WILL COMMENCE A TENDER OFFER TO ACQUIRE ALL OF THE OUTSTANDING SHARES OF RUTH\'S FOR $21.50 PER SHARE, IN AN ALL-CASH TRANSACTION WITH AN EQUITY VALUE OF APPROXIMATELY $715 MILLION.'}{'symbol': 'XRAY', 'date': '2023-05-03 06:00:00', 'title': 'DENTSPLY SIRONA REPORTS FIRST QUARTER 2023 RESULTS', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., MAY 03, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- DENTSPLY SIRONA INC. (“DENTSPLY SIRONA” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NASDAQ: XRAY) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2023.'}{'symbol': 'DXCM', 'date': '2023-05-03 04:00:00', 'title': 'DEXCOM RTCGM IS LIKELY TO BE COST-SAVING, STUDY SUGGESTS', 'te